            <strong>Pick Optimum Nutrition if</strong> you want a lean daily whey for a cut or for maintenance, you care about flavor choice (ON lists more than 20), or you want a protein that is mostly whey isolate. <strong>Pick Muscle Milk Pro Series if</strong> you want the lowest cost per gram of certified protein and do not mind about 30 extra calories per 25 g. <strong>Pick Muscle Milk Genuine if</strong> you are a hard gainer who wants a thick, calorie-dense shake. <strong>Pick the Muscle Milk carton over the ON carton if</strong> you mean the ready-to-drink shakes: it has 26 g of protein to ON's 24 g and costs less per gram.
