            One card for Gold Standard, two for the Muscle Milk powders that matter (Genuine and Pro Series), and one for each brand's ready-to-drink shake. Prices are the Amazon prices we saw on 19 November 2026 and will move.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
