            The method is simple: divide the price by the number of 25 g doses in the tub. The 5 lb Gold Standard Double Rich Chocolate has 74 servings of 24 g per ON's store, so it holds 1,776 g of protein, or about 71 doses of 25 g, and $105.99 divided by 71 is about $1.49. Pro Series has 28 servings of 50 g, so 56 doses, and $69.93 divided by 56 is about $1.25. Our <a href="/best-cheap-protein-powder/">cheap protein powder guide</a> uses the same math across more brands.
