          <p>
            Tub size matters more than brand here. The 2 lb Gold Standard works out to about $1.77 per 25 g at the price we saw, almost 30 cents more than the 5 lb tub. Muscle Milk is less predictable: the small 1.93 lb Genuine tub was cheaper per gram than the 4.94 lb chocolate tub we saw at $89.47, which works out to about $2.18. The 4.94 lb vanilla tub was listed at $59.29, or about $1.45. Check the per-gram price rather than assuming the big tub is the bargain.
