          <p>
            There is also a hidden cost in calories versus value. Pro Series is cheaper per gram of protein, but you also pay for maltodextrin and creamer in every scoop. If those calories are useful to you, Pro Series is simply the better deal. If you would be cutting food elsewhere to make room for them, Gold Standard's extra 24 cents per 25 g buys you a leaner shake. At one shake a day, that difference comes to roughly $7 a month.
