          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard is the better protein powder for most people: 24 g of protein in about 120 calories, whey isolate first on the label, and two flavors in the NSF Certified for Sport directory. It costs a little more per gram, about $1.49 per 25 g at the Amazon price we saw, and that premium buys a leaner, simpler scoop.
